    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Adult Visual Novel</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return home to save your father's mountain bathhouse business. Explore freely, interact with unique characters, and experience naughty encounters through <strong><u>fully voiced dialogue</u></strong> and <u><strong>animated scenes</strong></u>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Your Story Begins...</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048190/extras/67ec6fff6c0f79408029f61483c7ea27.poster.avif?t=1755334477\" width=736 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048190/extras/67ec6fff6c0f79408029f61483c7ea27.webm?t=1755334477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048190/extras/67ec6fff6c0f79408029f61483c7ea27.mp4?t=1755334477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life in the big city comes crashing to a halt when you're suddenly called home to save the bathhouse that's now been handed to you. Perched high in the mountains, this isn't your typical spa - and neither are its guests. At least you've got familiar faces to help keep things running.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048190/extras/e470daddd6c46715a64adda34624c14c.poster.avif?t=1755334477\" width=682 height=736 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048190/extras/e470daddd6c46715a64adda34624c14c.webm?t=1755334477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048190/extras/e470daddd6c46715a64adda34624c14c.mp4?t=1755334477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
